@startuml organization-value-stream-boundary
title Organization / Value Stream Boundary ; per ADR-ES-022 section 8

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Value Stream" as VS
class "Organization" as Org

VS --> Org : involves
Org -[dotted]- VS : is NOT
VS -[dotted]- Org : is NOT

note right
  Per ADR-ES-022 section 8:
  Value Stream involves Organization. An Organization participates
  in a Value Stream, but an Organization is NOT a Value Stream.
end note

@enduml
